.TH "nvme_init_get_log_mfg_default_config_status" 9 "nvme_init_get_log_mfg_default_config_status" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_get_log_mfg_default_config_status \- Initialize passthru command for Manufacturer Default Configuration Status
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_get_log_mfg_default_config_status
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_mfg_default_config_status_log *log "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "log" 12
User address to store the log
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Get Log command with
LID value NVME_LOG_LID_MFG_DEFAULT_CONFIG
